 "description": "The engine version of the Space Ark, superseding v4.2.5 while leaving H_core unchanged. Version 4.2.6 installs the engine layer—UKTP, Lexical Engine, Generative Disciplinary Engine, Space Ark Generator, Symbolon Architecture, and the Liberatory Operator Set—and adds runtime governance, room generation, and the Airlock Verification Swarm. It closes the recursive pipeline from documents to terms, transforms, rooms, disciplines, vehicles, and back to documents. The document combines Jack Feist’s 2015 poem “ARK” with a sealed formal object, activation protocols, status law, room and institution architecture, engines, automation, and failure tests. Assembly attestation is marked pending in the body and must not be silently upgraded.",
